===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{term|hundert|lang=gmh}}, ultimately from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{recons|hundaradą|lang=gem-pro}}, from {{recons|hundą|lang=gem-pro}} (< {{etyl|ine-pro|de}} {{recons|ḱm̥tóm||lang=ine-pro}}) + {{recons|radą||count|lang=gem-pro}}. The Duden derives Middle High German {{term|hundert|lang=gmh}} from {{etyl|osx|de}}.

